Halloween event, game updates and discounts up to 90%!

■ A special temporary event that turns the game into a "Pumpkin" for a week! Look for pumpkins in the game and get scared! ;)
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38564844/0c1203eb198184a232180b702c64dcab2f8c842a.png


■ Update:
▪ DRM protection has been completely removed;
▪ The game has been transferred to a new version of the engine, all technical aspects of the game have been updated;
▪ Updated leaderboards, added a general leaderboard;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.


■ Discounts for the whole week up to 90%! Hurry up to buy the game at a bargain price:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1399300/SOK_PRO/

Support for the game is in full swing, and now we are ready to present you with a major update for SOK PRO v2.0!

■ Completely redesigned the main technical base of the game;
■ Optimized the code;
■ Increased game stability;
■ Made a lot of graphical improvements;
■ Added anti-aliasing and sharpening when scaling;
■ Added support for 1440p WQHD monitors. Yes, even PlayStation5 does not support 2k monitors, but WE HAVE it!
■ Also improved support for small laptop monitors;
■ And Now the game supports a whole bunch of monitors, aspect ratios, and other display options;
■ Updated system requirements and added the latest information there;
■ And Now the game looks beautiful regardless of your display;
■ A huge number of minor fixes and fixes;
■ We did not forget about the support of the windowed mode, which is so convenient to play at work :)

What are we all about technical improvements? What has changed visually?
■ Everything has changed. Now the game has a new, beautiful and smoothed menu;
■ Improved controls section, added tips;
■ Completely changed the game interface;
■ Removed unnecessary, and added the necessary buttons to the gameplay interface;
■ The interface can be disabled on the fly by pressing "I" or through settings;
■ Reworked 5 new backgrounds for levels. Now they have become softer, more pleasant and more comfortable;
■ Backgrounds can be switched by numbers 1/2/3/4/5, or with a mouse;
■ Added a new, fourth lighting scheme or "skin" for levels;
■ We made a global redesign of the store page and SOK PRO library, how do you like it? =)

And now the section for the most mature boys and girls!
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1407710
■ We released a completely FREE dlc with 18+ content;
■ DLC includes the processing of 100 levels from SOK PRO;
■ Now it's even more fun to play with STRAWBERRY!
■ Different cute girls will help you solve puzzles;
■ And in order not to get bored, girls will gradually undress <3
■ What are you waiting for? Go and take SOK PRO SEX - FREE!

SOK PRO game has the lowest price possible in the System. Is it still dear to you? Then wait for discounts up to 50% which will begin on November 25th! Until then, add the game to your wishlist:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1399300

And don't forget to wear masks!
Just like the girls from our new expansion pack ^^
